 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Add `v1.FilesService.AddFile`, which encodes the multipart upload body
+  internally (as `AddRecording` already does for call log recordings) so the
+  request body is always replayable. Uploads made through `Files.Add` with a
+  hand-built, non-replayable body (e.g. streamed from an `*os.File`) were
+  silently skipped by the retry transport on 429/5xx.
+
+### Changed
+
+- Document on `v1.FilesService.Add` that retries require a body type
+  `http.NewRequest` recognizes as replayable, and point to `AddFile` for the
+  common case.
+
